// ============================================================================
// EclipticRD End-to-End Test — a real host orchestrator and the real client
// core on loopback: TLS-PSK bootstrap pairing (PIN -> consent -> grant), v3
// handshake, direction-separated UDP AES-GCM, HEVC encode -> chunk ->
